1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,636
7:42，4 路车上在下雨。
7:42. Rain on Line 4.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:08,648
后来太阳出来了，有人把伞忘在了车上。
Then the sun came out, and someone forgot their umbrella.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,670
它坐着车跑了一整天。晴天里，谁也不需要伞。
It rode the line all day. Nobody needs an umbrella in the sun.

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:25,225
到了终点站，它和另外 312 把伞待在了一起。
At the end of the line, it joined 312 others.

5
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:32,093
后来，晚高峰，暴雨又来了。
Then, at rush hour, the storm came back.

6
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,202
车场打开了所有的货架。
The depot opened every shelf.

7
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:42,715
313 把伞，回到了雨里。
313 umbrellas went back out into the rain.

8
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:49,052
晴天里丢的，雨天里找到了用处。
Lost on a sunny day. Found on a rainy one.
